{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>For this is the firstborn; place your right hand on his head.</b> For indeed the laying of the hand intends to direct the soul toward that on which it is laid, as in וַיִּסְמֹךְ אֶת יָדָיו עָלָיו (Numbers 27:23), and the power of the right hand is stronger than the power of the left, and the laying of the right upon the right directs more than the laying of the left upon the left would direct."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:11.601980973Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}